WEBVTT

00:10:59.914 --> 00:11:02.233
and the most important cathedral of the city,

00:11:02.233 --> 00:11:05.004
the symbol of Christchurch, was totally destroyed.

00:11:05.004 --> 00:11:09.102
And I was asked to come to rebuild the temporary cathedral.

00:11:09.102 --> 00:11:11.389
So this is under construction.

00:11:11.389 --> 00:11:14.729
And I'd like to keep building monuments

00:11:14.729 --> 00:11:16.959
that are beloved by people.

00:11:16.959 --> 00:11:18.398
Thank you very much.

00:11:18.398 --> 00:11:20.334
(Applause)

00:11:20.334 --> 00:11:23.067
Thank you. (Applause)

00:11:23.067 --> 00:11:25.824
Thank you very much. (Applause)